00:23:19,120 --> 00:23:32,400
And Cooper, a personalized running app, had a really good one of this before where they were also showing like the pain point of I actually knew the person in the ad, Esme, she's a fitness influencer and she was showing like, okay, this was my marathon time.

244
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,680
And then again and again.

245
00:23:33,840 --> 00:23:35,280
And each time I'm not improving.

