248
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:59,840
And so I think that transformation is such a good one and makes like a really good like ad because then it's like what you said, like it was only when you saw people like you that you thought it was for you.

249
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:06,640
And I think that's like a format of seeing people like you with the same struggle trying to do the same thing works really well.

