00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:45,040
You want to feel not just like that you look a certain way, but you feel strong, you feel good.

275
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:54,320
And they're showing literally people who look exactly like me and the transformation they're seeing that I'm like, I'm so tempted by this, but I really shouldn't.

276
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:56,320
Yeah, yeah.

277
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:58,160
It really is such a good example.

